17:52:46  == Your files
17:52:46  ClaudeOS can't open macOS's own files: on this Mac they're always encrypted, with keys only macOS can use
17:52:46  (FileVault or not). So setup copies the folders you choose onto a drive called ClaudeOS that both systems open;
17:52:46  macOS keeps its own copies. What you save on that drive in ClaudeOS is in macOS too, and you can send more
17:52:46  later (run setup again).
17:52:46  macOS may ask whether Terminal can open your Desktop, Documents and Downloads folders: choose OK.
